/-!
# Packages: recognizing cylinder coherators

The generic part of H §5.3 (H:3114–3177): a cylinder category with an h-terminal marked object,
cofibrant at that object, whose morphisms lift along pre-fibrations at h-terminal objects (the
conclusion of H Lemma 5.3.9 for `fgpd`), is a cylinder coherator. For finitely cellular
`∞`-groupoids the hypotheses are H Prop 5.3.7 (cofibrancy), Lemma 5.3.9 (lifting) and the
h-terminality of `D₀`.
-/

